<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κλίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend, turn aside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦκα
				πα&lt;&gt;ακλίνας κεφαλήν</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.301
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοὺς μυκτῆρας πρὸς</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς λαύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					157
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν πύλην</span>
			<i>set</i> it <i>ajar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.156
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς αὐλείας</span>
			<i>open a bit</i> of the hall-door, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				981
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλῃ παρκλίνωσι δίκας</span>
			<i>turn</i> justice <i>from her path</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				262
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1444b16
				</span></i>
			 ; of words, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρόν τι π</span>.
				<i>alter</i> slightly, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				410a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				400c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>lay beside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς λαγόνας
			γυναιξί</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				47.19
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρανακλίνω</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				1.13
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, <i>lie alongside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				54
			</span></i> ; <i>lie down beside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.293
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>lie side by side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				540a1
			</span></i> ; of adjacent lands, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πελοπηῒς ὅση παρακέκλιται Ἰσθμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					72
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>turn aside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				17.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>turn aside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.424
			</span></i> (where however <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους</span> may
			be supplied) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακλίνασα</span>
			<i>having swerved</i> from her first seeming, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				744
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>turn aside from, avoid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἁφὴν τὴν ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					745a26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
